{
  "name": "logistics-commissary",
  "checks": "CHECKS.md, Commissary from a logistics plan, rows W0, W3 and W6 (the fixture sets up what W2 does by hand)",
  "needs": {},
  "steps": [
    {
      "note": "Use FT saves from a new character of their own, never a series city saved under a new name. Prepare 'FT logistics' by hand: at least one food truck or cart (a licence isn't needed), the player on foot outside any building, enough money for a day's commissary rent. The fixture rents the rest; it reuses what an earlier run made, so the same save can run this twice."
    },
    {
      "call": "load",
      "args": {
        "name": "FT logistics"
      }
    },
    {
      "wait_state": "load.status",
      "timeout_s": 300,
      "not_equals": "pending"
    },
    {
      "expect": "state",
      "path": "load.status",
      "equals": "done"
    },
    {
      "wait_state": "scene",
      "timeout_s": 300,
      "equals": "city"
    },
    {
      "wait_state": "licence",
      "timeout_s": 300,
      "not_equals": null
    },
    {
      "call": "time",
      "args": {
        "pause": true
      }
    },
    {
      "call": "fixture",
      "args": {
        "name": "logistics",
        "site": "hells-kitchen",
        "stock": [
          {
            "item": "ba:itemname_hotdog",
            "units": 200
          }
        ],
        "targets": [
          {
            "item": "ba:itemname_hotdog",
            "amount": 40
          }
        ]
      },
      "timeout_s": 60
    },
    {
      "expect": "result",
      "path": "complete",
      "equals": true
    },
    {
      "expect": "result",
      "path": "plan.destinations[site=hells-kitchen].targets[item=ba:itemname_hotdog].target",
      "equals": 40
    },
    {
      "expect": "state",
      "path": "commissary.spaces[site=hells-kitchen].site",
      "equals": "hells-kitchen"
    },
    {
      "remember": "warehouse",
      "from": "result",
      "path": "warehouse.address"
    },
    {
      "call": "logistics",
      "args": {
        "op": "run",
        "warehouse": "$warehouse"
      },
      "timeout_s": 60
    },
    {
      "wait_event": "Commissary logistics: .+ to hells-kitchen: ",
      "timeout_s": 10
    },
    {
      "expect": "result",
      "path": "before",
      "length": 1
    },
    {
      "remember": "warehouse_before",
      "from": "result",
      "path": "before.0.warehouse.stock[item=ba:itemname_hotdog].amount"
    },
    {
      "remember": "held_before",
      "from": "result",
      "path": "before.0.destinations[site=hells-kitchen].targets[item=ba:itemname_hotdog].held"
    },
    {
      "expect": "result",
      "path": "after.0.destinations[site=hells-kitchen].targets[item=ba:itemname_hotdog].held",
      "equals": 40
    },
    {
      "expect": "result",
      "path": "after.0.warehouse.stock[item=ba:itemname_hotdog].amount",
      "less": "$warehouse_before"
    },
    {
      "expect": "result",
      "path": "after.0.destinations[site=hells-kitchen].targets[item=ba:itemname_hotdog].held",
      "greater": "$held_before"
    },
    {
      "remember": "warehouse_after",
      "from": "result",
      "path": "after.0.warehouse.stock[item=ba:itemname_hotdog].amount"
    },
    {
      "note": "A second run with the stock at its target brings nothing (W3's second night)."
    },
    {
      "call": "logistics",
      "args": {
        "op": "run",
        "warehouse": "$warehouse"
      },
      "timeout_s": 60
    },
    {
      "wait_event": "Commissary logistics: .+ to hells-kitchen: nothing brought \\(0 units\\)",
      "timeout_s": 10
    },
    {
      "call": "save",
      "args": {
        "name": "FT logistics ready"
      },
      "timeout_s": 120
    },
    {
      "note": "W6: load the saved fixture and check the plan, its target and both stocks came back."
    },
    {
      "call": "load",
      "args": {
        "name": "FT logistics ready"
      }
    },
    {
      "wait_state": "load.status",
      "timeout_s": 300,
      "not_equals": "pending"
    },
    {
      "expect": "state",
      "path": "load.status",
      "equals": "done"
    },
    {
      "wait_state": "scene",
      "timeout_s": 300,
      "equals": "city"
    },
    {
      "wait_event": "Commissary logistics: \\d+ plan destinations at commissaries: .*hells-kitchen from ",
      "timeout_s": 30,
      "after_step": 26
    },
    {
      "call": "logistics",
      "args": {
        "op": "status",
        "warehouse": "$warehouse"
      }
    },
    {
      "expect": "result",
      "path": "plans",
      "length": 1
    },
    {
      "expect": "result",
      "path": "plans.0.manager.id",
      "not_equals": null
    },
    {
      "expect": "result",
      "path": "plans.0.max_destinations",
      "greater": 0
    },
    {
      "expect": "result",
      "path": "plans.0.destinations[site=hells-kitchen].targets[item=ba:itemname_hotdog].target",
      "equals": 40
    },
    {
      "expect": "result",
      "path": "plans.0.destinations[site=hells-kitchen].targets[item=ba:itemname_hotdog].held",
      "equals": 40
    },
    {
      "expect": "result",
      "path": "plans.0.warehouse.stock[item=ba:itemname_hotdog].amount",
      "equals": "$warehouse_after"
    },
    {
      "note": "Peter: BizMan, the headquarters' logistics screen. The plan names the warehouse and the commissary (W2's dropdown entry), but its manager dropdown reads Unassigned: the fixture's manager has no work shift (the headquarters has no workstation), and the dropdown lists only managers with one. The 02:00 run still delivers. Don't pick a manager there and don't edit the headquarters' schedule: the game then unassigns the manager (ScheduleHelper.UpdateHQPlans) and nothing is delivered. 'FT logistics ready' is the save to start W3 to W9 from."
    }
  ]
}
